    <Title>Benchmark B1 Physics Fidelity</Title>
    <Subject>Five-case perturbation ladder with identical initial conditions</Subject>
    <Category>Benchmark</Category>
    <Keywords>B1,physics fidelity,J2,drag,SRP</Keywords>
    <Comments>Headless 5-case B1 propagation. Run: ff -mp benchmark_b1_physics_fidelity.MissionPlan -tmps -hwm</Comments>
    <Notes>Frozen orbit: 500 km SSO-like LEO, epoch 2026-06-02 UTC. Default duration 24 h (86400 s). Edit SIM_DURATION_S at top of script for 7 d runs.</Notes>
